<div class="flex_column_table av-2uvis7-fbe53130a8df1137ab7a90528ee60767 sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-2uvis7-fbe53130a8df1137ab7a90528ee60767 av_one_half avia-builder-el-4 el_before_av_one_half avia-builder-el-first first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-middle"><div class="av-special-heading av-m8oqb7iv-86219e5e7e613dde2dfe53fa08302e76 av-special-heading-h1 blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-5 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h1 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Advanced Medical Testing Services</h1><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m8oqbyek-5009bcaae3562b9fcd63756228aefa58" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><p>At <a href="/">Casa Privée</a>, we provide unparalleled medical testing services, positioning ourselves as the foremost choice in the world for personalized testing. Our <a href="/">Miami addiction clinic</a> offers comprehensive test packages designed meticulously to meet your medical needs and provide answers and peace of mind.</p>
<p>We take pride in being the exclusive national facility offering extensive, premium diagnostic services, ensuring that our elite clients receive the most advanced and thorough health assessments possible.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-m8oq3gyq-26f0609d03d2b79758a144eadefa5bbf av_one_half avia-builder-el-7 el_after_av_one_half avia-builder-el-last flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-middle"><div class="avia-image-container av-18f5wlj-b0103e70da46ebca27efbea95ff8dfd8 av-styling- avia-align-center avia-builder-el-8 avia-builder-el-no-sibling" itemprop="image" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="avia-image-container-inner"><div class="avia-image-overlay-wrap"><img alt="Advanced medical testing services in Miami. Genetic and blood testing at Casa Privée." class="wp-image-1528 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-1528 avia_image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="375" itemprop="thumbnailUrl" sizes="(max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Advanced-Medical-Testing-Services.webp" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Advanced-Medical-Testing-Services.webp 576w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Advanced-Medical-Testing-Services-300x195.webp 300w" title="Advanced Medical Testing Services" width="576"/></div></div></div></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 -->
</div></div></div><!-- close content main div --></div></div><div class="avia-section av-m8oqiwq0-39f0ffea9ae98bd02c814ba02a69c17b main_color avia-section-large avia-no-border-styling avia-builder-el-9 el_after_av_section el_before_av_section avia-full-stretch avia-bg-style-fixed av-section-color-overlay-active container_wrap fullsize" data-section-bg-repeat="stretch" id="av_section_3"><div class="av-section-color-overlay-wrap"><div class="av-section-color-overlay"></div><div class="container av-section-cont-open"><div class="template-page content av-content-full alpha units"><div class="post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-1511"><div class="entry-content-wrapper clearfix">
<div class="flex_column av-sbon-6572c38a36c8a501317196138dd6b13e av_one_full avia-builder-el-10 avia-builder-el-no-sibling first flex_column_div"><div class="av-special-heading av-m8oqfm7d-bf5d3b1c62dfff10a03f460960e5a7ac av-special-heading-h3 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-11 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h3 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Why are Advanced Medical Tests Important?</h3><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m8oqioto-23a2ea80b696902d538f19a0b8a8801d" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Premium, personalized testing enables early disease detection, helps our doctors develop precise <a href="treatment-programs.php">personal treatment plans</a>, and improves outcomes. It means we catch and treat things in their earliest stages before they become serious conditions.</p>
<p><strong>There is a significant value in understanding your genetic profile, identifying potential risk factors, and achieving optimal health and longevity.</strong></p>
<p><a href="about-us.php">Our doctors</a> are dedicated to optimizing your health, and as a result, we practice with advanced methods in all areas, including testing and diagnostic services. The more we understand about your body, how it works, and what makes it thrive, the sooner you’ll feel better and enjoy your life more.</p>
</div></section></div>
</div></div></div><!-- close content main div --></div></div></div><div class="avia-section av-m8osvzuo-91b126fd3766428ebdd4a7937332edb5 main_color avia-section-default avia-no-border-styling avia-builder-el-13 el_after_av_section el_before_av_section avia-bg-style-scroll container_wrap fullsize" id="av_section_4"><div class="container av-section-cont-open"><div class="template-page content av-content-full alpha units"><div class="post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-1511"><div class="entry-content-wrapper clearfix">
<div class="flex_column av-16pnedj-bf91d1848b75dded5ae28d1742c2875e av_one_full avia-builder-el-14 el_before_av_one_half avia-builder-el-first first flex_column_div"><div class="av-special-heading av-448ysn-964fb4cc75ccdd80bdd5d94e6c3ec33a av-special-heading-h2 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-15 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h2 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Our Diagnostic Testing Modules</h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-12ous1z-0b0c6bbd4c797af2a47c4d35f0853f5a" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>At Casa Privée, we offer six diagnostic testing modules, each with a specific and important benefit to your health and well-being. Diagnostic testing includes a physical examination and consultation.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="flex_column_table av-111wfqf-37831f19e1482586248809f4239c5e22 sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-111wfqf-37831f19e1482586248809f4239c5e22 av_one_half avia-builder-el-17 el_after_av_one_full el_before_av_one_half first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-zdcfsn-2270d566665204ce272fd6fafc9eb8a5 av-special-heading-h5 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-18 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h5 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Hematology / Biochemistry</h5><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
