</div></div></div><div class="avia-section av-ar1i3r-b785bddd91bfb5ab1654d0c930fc7d36 main_color avia-section-large avia-no-border-styling avia-builder-el-57 el_after_av_layout_row el_before_av_section avia-bg-style-scroll container_wrap fullsize" id="av_section_7"><div class="container av-section-cont-open"><div class="template-page content av-content-full alpha units"><div class="post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-1511"><div class="entry-content-wrapper clearfix">
<div class="flex_column_table av-8zgep3-fe6d391b62c48c3dc76252e873b5e4d6 sc-av_one_full av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-8zgep3-fe6d391b62c48c3dc76252e873b5e4d6 av_one_full avia-builder-el-58 el_before_av_one_fourth avia-builder-el-first first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top"><div class="av-special-heading av-m8ortlfm-42888315ed5fcb53009b75cd456abe69 av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-59 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Hormonal Analysis</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m8ortvzk-377f27ca96648daf043a4ece037a6b55" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Hormonal analysis is crucial for understanding overall health and well-being. Various hormones play significant roles in the body’s functioning, and monitoring their levels is essential.</p>
</div></section></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 --><div class="flex_column_table av-7mfd13-54fc7f7e779e6fad53032404eab4a972 sc-av_one_fourth av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-7mfd13-54fc7f7e779e6fad53032404eab4a972 av_one_fourth avia-builder-el-61 el_after_av_one_full el_before_av_one_fourth first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-m8oru5l3-f32f07fcd93eb37b6fa5e8cb3ec75732 av-special-heading-h5 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-62 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size av-linked-heading"><h5 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline"><a class="av-heading-link" href="hyperbaric-oxygen-therapy-hbot.php">Stress Hormones (Cortisol): </a></h5><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m8osbbyr-1e829fc89381e6d6cf28e03a788ab388" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Elevated cortisol levels may indicate chronic stress, which can lead to various health issues, including anxiety, <a href="depression-treatment.php">depression</a>, and metabolic disorders.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-5cljnb-98269f1b459da7e4299b73d067848b39 av_one_fourth avia-builder-el-64 el_after_av_one_fourth el_before_av_one_fourth flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-m8osbm3s-2878c780f8e511f876181ba5f470e821 av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-65 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Thyroid Hormones</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m8osbsqg-721088ac3513bf563539ed18d301b22c" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>The thyroid gland regulates metabolism, energy levels, and overall health. An imbalance, whether it is hypothyroidism or hyperthyroidism, can have significant effects on weight, mood, and energy levels.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-fkqcn-be1564caab43c85b7da8959fae36ba48 av_one_fourth avia-builder-el-67 el_after_av_one_fourth el_before_av_one_fourth flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-m8osc0zf-852bf63e2b70c9cdfe3c36c171bc4692 av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-68 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Parathyroid Hormones</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m8osc9a3-7e38aeccd26298f7b98ab6f8a54d7924" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>These hormones regulate calcium levels in the blood, influencing bone health and muscle Abnormal levels can lead to conditions like osteoporosis or kidney stones.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-2irs1z-ebc6cad295751b5ebd946d8d71e02faf av_one_fourth avia-builder-el-70 el_after_av_one_fourth avia-builder-el-last flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-m8oscfo8-61c7f3a5be2552c4f9b064c4f98f0268 av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-71 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size av-linked-heading"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline"><a class="av-heading-link" href="neurostar-tms-therapy.php">Sexual Hormones</a></h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m8oscqbn-ba36c328defe9e856ac453c1973f4494" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Estrogen, testosterone, and progesterone influence sexual health, reproductive function, and imbalances that can affect fertility and overall energy.</p>
</div></section></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 --></div></div></div><!-- close content main div --></div></div><div class="avia-section av-5cojo7-70bd38975838e670dee026f6ba757362 main_color avia-section-large avia-no-border-styling avia-builder-el-73 el_after_av_section el_before_av_section avia-bg-style-scroll container_wrap fullsize" id="av_section_8"><div class="container av-section-cont-open"><div class="template-page content av-content-full alpha units"><div class="post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-1511"><div class="entry-content-wrapper clearfix">
<div class="flex_column_table av-47sx9z-9c56eb3049db2155ce06e8653dabcb6b sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-47sx9z-9c56eb3049db2155ce06e8653dabcb6b av_one_half avia-builder-el-74 el_before_av_one_half avia-builder-el-first first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top"><div class="avia-image-container av-m8othp8d-aff745b39c4546771e4fcabebdd12a93 av-styling- avia-align-center avia-builder-el-75 avia-builder-el-no-sibling" itemprop="image" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="avia-image-container-inner"><div class="avia-image-overlay-wrap"><img alt="Genetic testing in Miami includes analyzing DNA sequences to detect cancer risks early. DNA testing in Miami, Casa Privée." class="wp-image-1529 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-1529 avia_image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="394" itemprop="thumbnailUrl" sizes="(max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Our-Diagnostic-Testing-Modules.webp" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Our-Diagnostic-Testing-Modules.webp 576w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Our-Diagnostic-Testing-Modules-300x205.webp 300w" title="Our Diagnostic Testing Modules" width="576"/></div></div></div></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-1zwc6f-4a48b82d022655e6f3c89befe88587f0 av_one_half avia-builder-el-76 el_after_av_one_half el_before_av_one_full flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top"><div class="av-special-heading av-m8or0okf-f8ee3805adf19e39ccc770e938b5a79c av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-77 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Genetic Testing</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m8or19hq-2f333321140720ef35acc321a3bbf25b" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Genetic testing analyzes DNA sequences and offers insights into your true biological age, which may differ from your chronological age. This understanding can help tailor personalized health strategies and lifestyle changes to promote longevity and well-being.</p>
<p><strong>Genetic testing empowers you with knowledge, enabling you to make informed decisions about screenings and preventive measures.</strong></p>
<p>Cancer risk analysis is particularly significant, as it identifies genetic predispositions to various types of cancer. Early detection and intervention can substantially improve outcomes, making it vital for individuals with a family history of cancer.</p>
</div></section></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 --><div class="flex_column av-9d5lbr-7057e9b64cfa2ff30f23e135164373bf av_one_full avia-builder-el-79 el_after_av_one_half avia-builder-el-last first flex_column_div column-top-margin"><div class="hr av-m8osig1z-6fd6c8fcb5ab6d97695b6d1a143fc6cd hr-custom avia-builder-el-80 el_before_av_heading avia-builder-el-first hr-center hr-icon-no"><span class="hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat"><span class="hr-inner-style"></span></span></div>
<div class="av-special-heading av-m8osgfh3-37bcdc3918168451bf55bb87c947483b av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-81 el_after_av_hr el_before_av_textblock av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Brain/Blood Transmitter Analysis</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m8osgm09-f11aaad15862e7350274edbfc738352b" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Brain and blood transmitter analysis focuses on dopamine and serotonin, which regulate mood, behavior, and cognitive functions. These neurotransmitters are often associated with mental health conditions, where imbalances can lead to disorders like <a href="neurostar-tms-therapy.php">depression and anxiety</a>.</p>
<p>Analyzing specific markers in the brain and bloodstream leads to more effective treatments and help if you are experiencing related mental health issues.</p>
</div></section></div>
<p></p>
</div></div></div><!-- close content main div --></div></div><div class="avia-section av-5kvoo7-a3b7f8fcfa11445e785877c69759d894 main_color avia-section-large avia-no-border-styling avia-builder-el-83 el_after_av_section el_before_av_section avia-full-stretch avia-bg-style-scroll container_wrap fullsize" data-section-bg-repeat="stretch" id="av_section_9"><div class="container av-section-cont-open"><div class="template-page content av-content-full alpha units"><div class="post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-1511"><div class="entry-content-wrapper clearfix">
<div class="flex_column av-4vzzav-3d8049345430c9b398048fdb987ccff7 av_one_half avia-builder-el-84 el_before_av_one_half avia-builder-el-first first flex_column_div"><div class="av-special-heading av-m8oqym6v-c9f18b1e38fe0147aecaa7b926a88fec av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-85 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Medical Imaging</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m8oqz0hn-70120c2af8004470ff35e55a0130250f" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Full body scans provide a comprehensive overview of your health, allowing for the identification of potential issues before they become serious. This proactive approach can lead to timely interventions, ultimately improving patient outcomes.</p>
<ul>
<li>Additionally, brain metabolic scans are essential for assessing neurological health, helping to diagnose disorders such as Alzheimer’s or other cognitive impairments.</li>
</ul>
<p>By utilizing advanced imaging techniques, we can develop personalized treatment plans, enhance monitoring of disease progression, and significantly improve the quality of care.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="flex_column av-2k65br-4438dc4a022c32697b8a89ccbef0190a av_one_half avia-builder-el-87 el_after_av_one_half avia-builder-el-last flex_column_div"></div>
</div></div></div><!-- close content main div --></div></div><div class="avia-section av-70agrb-1ecba8b3cc7e4fed569cfe15102f3a13 main_color avia-section-default avia-no-border-styling avia-builder-el-88 el_after_av_section avia-builder-el-last avia-bg-style-scroll container_wrap fullsize" id="av_section_10"><div class="container av-section-cont-open"><div class="template-page content av-content-full alpha units"><div class="post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-1511"><div class="entry-content-wrapper clearfix">
<div class="flex_column av-6fdi9z-f7dd9399e344b5b213e92f0483350756 av_one_full avia-builder-el-89 avia-builder-el-no-sibling first flex_column_div"><div class="av-special-heading av-4hefjr-69d127b634b42cb25d547172628be51a av-special-heading-h2 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-90 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h2 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Medical Tests | Miami Concierge Clinic</h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-2s8saf-309239dd6a7a40845513852676c930a5" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><p>Undergoing advanced medical tests will provide invaluable insights into your overall <a href="/">health and wellness</a>. These comprehensive analyses, such as hematology and biochemistry tests, can detect underlying conditions that may not be apparent through routine examinations.</p>
<p>By evaluating factors like immune response, hormonal levels, and genetic markers, you can better understand your health status and potential risks. Advanced testing, including nutrient surveys and blood transmitter analyses, helps identify deficiencies or imbalances that can impact both physical and mental well-being.</p>
<p>At Casa Privée, we develop personalized health strategies, enabling proactive measures to prevent diseases like cancer or cardiovascular issues. Medical imaging further enhances this proactive approach by identifying early structural abnormalities or metabolic changes.</p>
<p>Ultimately, investing in advanced medical tests at our <a href="/">addiction clinic in Miami</a> allows for a tailored healthcare plan, promoting a longer, healthier life through informed decision-making.</p>
